  "title": "Oily Garlicky Jamaican Frankfurter Stew",
  "description": "A flavorful and aromatic Jamaican stew made with frankfurters, garlic, and beurre-monte, cooked to perfection in a claypot. This dish is a great weeknight option that is also Buddhist-temple-friendly.",
