  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in the claypot over medium heat.",
    "Add the sliced frankfurters and cook until browned.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook until fragrant.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add the allspice, thyme, and scotch bonnet peppers, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the beurre-monte and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired."
